    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "CME Naas are delighted to welcome you to 16 Hillview, Bellingsfield, a spacious 4 bedroom semi detached home nestled within this ever popular development, built by Ballymore. Constructed in 2018, this fine home offers spacious and well laid out accommodation ideal for modern living. Energy Efficient with an Air to Water Heat Pump and superior insulation affording an A3 BER rating. This particular house type (The Hazel), benefits not only from a spacious Lounge with Wood Burning Stove, but also an additional living area/tv area just off the kitchen, making it ideal for families. Bellingsfield boasts extensive walk ways and green space as well as some exquisite country views. There is the added advantage of an on-site educational campus with a choice of primary and post primary schools. Killashee Hotel & Spa is a mere stone throw away and Naas Town Centre can be reached by comfortable walk. Viewing by strict appointment with CME. The M7 motorway is easily accessible within 5 minutes at Naas South.\r\nViewing comes highly recommended and is by appointment with CME Naas."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall: c. 6.7m x 2m\r\nWood effect tiled floor.\r\n\r\nGuest WC: c. 1.6m x 1.5m\r\nWC, WHB, with vanity unit, tiled floor, heated towel rail\r\n\r\nLounge: c. 5.3m x 4m\r\nFeature bay window . Wood burning stove with quartz surround. Laminate walnut style wood flooring, double doors to hallway.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Area: c. 8m x 3.7m\r\nExtensive range of Shaker style kitchen units (By Savvy Kitchens) with a substantial island incorporating sink. Quartz worktops and upstands, 2 x integrated electric ovens, electric hob and integrated dishwasher and fridge/freezer. French doors opening to paved patio area and West facing rear garden.\r\n\r\nUtility Room Area:\r\nc. 2.5m x 2.2m\r\nWood effect tiled floor. Plumbed for washing machine and ample space for dryer. Door to rear garden.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom: c. 4.2m x 3.4m\r\nExtensive built in wardrobes, laminate wood floor\r\n\r\nEn-Suite: c. 2.5m x 1.6m\r\nWC WHB with vanity unit and vanity light, rain head shower with black frame sliding shower door and double width tray, Tiled floor and wet area and ½ tiled walls.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: c. 3.7m x 3.3m\r\nExtensive range of built in wardrobes, laminate wood floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: c. 3m x 2.7m\r\nLaminate wood floor, built in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4: c. 2.6m x 2.6m\r\nLaminate wood floor, built in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBathroom: c. 1.78m x 2.45m\r\nWC, WHB with vanity unit and vanity light, bath with attachment, extensive tiling."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "4 bedroom home extending to c.144Sq.M\r\nSunny West facing rear garden large patio and elevated lawn area.\r\nHigh Quality Bathrooms,: Family bathroom, ensuite and Guest WC\r\nEnergy Efficient A rated home with Air to Water Heat Pump\r\nQuality Kitchen By Savvy Designs with large Quartz topped curved Edge Island and integrated appliances.\r\nOn site educational campus & walking track.\r\nWalking distance to Naas town centre and a short stroll to Kilashee School & Kilashee House Hotel & Leisure centre.\r\nWood Burning Stove in Lounge\r\nHazel House Type with additional seating area/tv area off kitchen\r\nSpacious Utility Room\r\nExcellent accessibility links with M7/M9 access only 5 minutes away at Naas South and Sallins Arrow Rail link 10 minutes away."
      },
      {
